    "Install Ollama from [ollama.ai](https://ollama.ai) and run:\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "ollama pull qwen3:30b\n",
    "# or alternatively:\n",
    "# ollama pull gpt-oss\n",
    "# ollama pull deepseek-r1\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
